<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Raunak ❤️ Aradhya</title>

<style>

body{
margin:0;
font-family:Arial;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff4e8a,#ff8fab);
text-align:center;
color:white;
overflow:hidden;
}

h1{
font-size:55px;
margin-top:20px;
}

img{
width:260px;
border-radius:20px;
box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
margin-top:20px;
}

p{
width:80%;
margin:auto;
font-size:18px;
margin-top:20px;
}

button{
padding:12px 25px;
font-size:18px;
border:none;
border-radius:30px;
margin:10px;
cursor:pointer;
}

.yes{
background:#00ff88;
color:black;
}

.no{
background:#ff4444;
color:white;
position:relative;
}

.heart{
position:absolute;
bottom:-10px;
font-size:20px;
animation:float 6s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes float{
0%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:1;}
100%{transform:translateY(-100vh);opacity:0;}
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<h1>RAUNAK LOVE ARADHYA ❤️</h1>

<img src="photo.jpg">

<p>
<b>
Aradhya meri jaan, pata nahi kaise par tum meri life ka sabse beautiful hissa ban gayi ho. Jab bhi tumhari yaad aati hai na, dil automatically smile karne lagta hai. Shayad distance sirf 29 km ka hai, par tum mere dil ke bilkul paas rehti ho. Tumhari smile, tumhari baatein aur tumhara care karna mere liye duniya ki sabse precious cheez hai. Kabhi kabhi sochta hu ki life kitni boring hoti agar tum meri life me nahi aati. Tum sirf meri girlfriend nahi ho, tum meri happiness ho, meri peace ho aur meri favourite person ho. Main bas itna chahta hu ki humesha tumhare saath rahu aur tumhe har din special feel karaun. Bas ek simple sa question hai mere dil me jo main tumse poochna chahta hu.
</b>
</p>

<h2>Will you marry me Aradhya? 💍</h2>

<button class="yes" onclick="yes()">Yes ❤️</button>
<button class="no" onmouseover="move()">No 😅</button>

<h3 id="result"></h3>

<script>

function yes(){
document.getElementById("result").innerHTML="Yay ❤️ Mujhe pata tha tum haan hi bologi. I love you Aradhya 💞";
}

function move(){
let btn=document.querySelector(".no");
btn.style.position="absolute";
btn.style.left=Math.random()*80+"%";
btn.style.top=Math.random()*80+"%";
}

setInterval(()=>{
let heart=document.createElement("div");
heart.className="heart";
heart.innerHTML="❤️";
heart.style.left=Math.random()*100+"%";
heart.style.fontSize=(20+Math.random()*20)+"px";
document.body.appendChild(heart);

setTimeout(()=>heart.remove(),6000);

},300);

</script>

</body>
</html>